Value time (.\d\d:\d\d:\d\d.)
Value attacker (You|Your)
Value action (slash|crush|slashes|crushes|pierces|hits)
Value target ([a-z+|A-Z+|0-9+|\s|()|']+|you)
Value combo ([a-z+|A-Z+|0-9+|\s|()|']+)
Value damage (\d+)
Value damage_type (holy|unholy|fire|electrical|frost|crushing)
Value crit (critically|crits)

Start
 ^${time}\s${attacker}(?:'s)?\s${crit}\s${action}\s${target}\sfor\s${damage} -> Record
